bonanza creek ranch has had two people  accidentally shot this is script's  assistant mamie mitchell calling 9-1-1  immediately after helena hutchins was  fatally wounded by alec baldwin she says  that the hollywood veteran should have  known better that it was his  responsibility to check the gun wasn't  loaded before firing and mitchell has  taken on one of america's highest  profile lawyers to sue baldwin himself  for the trauma she's suffered since in  our opinion  mr baldwin  chose to play russian roulette  when he fired a gun  without checking it  and without having the armorer do so in  his presence mitchell says she was  standing fewer than four feet from  hutchins seen here in the woolly hat  inside this church set when the 42 year  old was killed  she says the scene they were rehearsing  for would not have required a gun to be  fired  then an explosion  deafening loud gunshot  i was stunned  i heard someone moaning and i turned  around and my director was falling  backwards and holding his upper body and  i turned around toward alec and i saw  helena going down to the left of me  mitchell has worked in the film industry  for 40 years she says her career may now  be over because of the trauma including  the moment she found out hutchins had  died in hospital i stood in my driveway  screaming  i'll never forget what happened on the  set of rust that day  i relived the shooting and the sound of  the explosion  from the gun over and over again  i'm depressed i don't feel safe i feel  like at any moment anything could happen  to me  and to those that i care about that are  standing close to me  the production team including baldwin  say safety of cast and crew is always  their top priority and that they're  conducting their own internal review of  procedures  almost one month since helena hutchins  died while making a film every scene of  this tragedy continues to be played out  in public martha kellner sky news
 

